  "scope": "Accuracy and smooth-stop thresholds apply to known model-matched process load only. Unknown load has force/rate=0; its actual error and stop metrics are reported without those claims. Both assisted strategies share the startup boundary regularization and all public parameters except their gain-scheduling flag. Their nonzero initial command equals the calculated unshaped valve target while the physical valve starts at zero; its homogeneous initial mismatch decays with the real valve pole. The initial command step is recorded separately from subsequent startup smoothness. Startup delay is bounded by max(5*valve_tau, Ts); the previous one-sample criterion remains reported as measured. For quantized bare PID the pointwise convergence bound is one ADC LSB; assisted groups retain one-quarter LSB. Original quarter result and ADC-code disagreements remain recorded."
